It calls `sc_card_free`, not `sc_disconnect_card`. So `coolkey_finish` is NOT called. No double-free here.

But what if `coolkey_initialize` succeeds? Then `card->drv_data = priv`. Later, `sc_disconnect_card` calls `coolkey_finish` which calls `coolkey_free_private_data(priv)`. This is fine - single free.

